OL,3,GNEWSAHockey player first to represent
OL,4,AEngland at 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first England hockey player to
OL,7,Fstill be playing at international level
OL,8,Fat 90 says "age does not matter" when
OL,9,Fit comes to enjoying sport.
OL,11,FBill Greenwood, who lives near
OL,12,FLangport, in Somerset, has been playing
OL,13,Ffield hockey since the mid-1960s.
OL,15,FEarlier this month, he represented
OL,16,FEngland Over 80s at the World Cup in
OL,17,Fthe Netherlands and still plays and
OL,18,Fcoaches for Yeovil and Sherborne hockey
OL,19,Fclub.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
