OL,3,GNEWSAHockey player first to represent
OL,4,AEngland at 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreenwood said: "It was fantastic, it's
OL,7,Fthe sort of thing you dream about and
OL,8,Fcertainly when I started playing I
OL,9,Fdidn't think I would be playing at this
OL,10,Fage, I probably thought I would be
OL,11,Fdead."
